  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Predictive Batch Processing with Vertex AI",
    "splashDescription": "This blueprint integrates Camunda with Google Cloud Vertex AI to automate the batch prediction process. It involves uploading data files, converting them to JSON format, and using a pre-deployed machine learning model for outcome predictions. The entire process is fully automated, from job initiation through to the retrieval of prediction results, ensuring efficient, scalable, and reliable data processing.",
